WEBVTT

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.810
<i>Kanami-chan...</i>

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.400
Send an urgent message to the heads of both

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.130
the Heijou Institute and Minoseki Academy.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:34.460
Katana Maidens

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:52.370
<b>Episode 2  The Distance Between Them</b>

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.270
This is far enough. Let's split up.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.710
H-Hang on, you can't do this by yourself.

00:01:57.070 --> 00:02:01.710
You're in no condition to generate utsushi 
after using such a powerful jin'i.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.370
What?!

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.830
You said you wanted to finish 
our match, did you not?

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:07.830
Then I shall face off with you now.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.560
I-I'm telling you, that's not a good idea.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:12.610
You accompanying me any 
further would be a nuisance.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.810
Will you face off with me here?
 If not, then leave.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:19.690
What are you going to do now, Hiyori-chan?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.060
There's something that I have to finish.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.440
So that means getting caught 
would be a problem, right?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:28.820
That's right.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.620
Then all you can do is run away.
 I'll go with you!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:37.670
I mean, if we work together,
we can manage like we did earlier.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.840
Do you even realize what you're saying?

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.300
I do.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.930
I know that means things might get rough.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:49.140
And that it might cause 
problems for a lot of people.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:52.560
But I'll keep running away with you like this!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.440
Come on, hurry!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.270
What are your actual intentions?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:04.630
Like I said, to get away somewhere safe...

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:05.730
Why?

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:09.910
Because I want to spar with you 
properly once you've recovered.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:22.130
I don't know what you're after, but I 
will abandon you if you get in my way.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:25.130
Does that mean I can go with you?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.850
Do as you wish.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.140
Okay, I will, then!

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:41.020
<b>Juujou Kagari-sama</b>

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:45.030
<i>Under these circumstances, I should probably 
dispose of this as soon as possible.</i>

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.990
Did you hide that here earlier?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.990
Before I ran into you in 
front of the gate yesterday.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.080
I didn't think I would be able to escape

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.510
after crossing blades with Origami Yukari.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:03.130
Crap! I totally left my cell phone 
and luggage behind at the inn!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.640
Forget about it.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.120
In any case, they would be 
able to find out where we are

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.970
if you had the phone you were 
given by the Sword Administration.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:15.890
I wish I'd eaten all the cookies 
Mai-chan gave me yesterday.

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.900
I cannot think of any 
reason why she would do that.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.900
We aren't very familiar
with Juujou-san either.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.900
Was Etou Kanami acting 
strangely at all yesterday?

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.660
Not that I could tell. She really 
was acting like she always does.

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:38.670
When they escaped, I do not believe they 
would have been able to cooperate

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:42.670
to repel the elite guard, even for an instant,
without some kind of training.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.170
I don't know about that, either.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.060
Yanase Mai likely doesn't know anything.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.930
Iwakura Sanae was the same way, though.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:03.250
For them to be able to draw 
their swords on Yukari-sama...

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.730
I am ashamed of myself as 
one of the elite guard.

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:10.900
But why did Yukari-sama stop us that time?

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:13.250
I am sure she has her reasons.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:18.460
We will likely come to understand 
why she did it later.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.720
More importantly, do you think this incident

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.040
has something to do with that organization?

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.790
It's hard to tell right now.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:31.170
Do you mean until both the 
schools' presidents arrive?

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.890
That worked out well!

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.270
Okay, we're on the highway.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.360
So this is all we have for money.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.030
Is that an analog spectrum meter?

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.450
It's an antique!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.230
There's noro inside of there, right?

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.160
I've used one in class before.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:05.420
Everyone used to use one before the 
restrictions on collecting noro were enforced.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.230
Whose is this?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.690
Was your mother a Toji, too, Hiyori-chan?

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.420
Too?

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:16.460
My mom was a Toji. They say 
she was really powerful.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.050
What was the name?

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.870
Of my mother?

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.230
Your name.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.650
How mean, Hiyori-chan! 
You don't know my name?!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.940
It's Kanami! Etou Kanami!

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.190
You're too loud!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:40.080
Looks like they haven't caught those two yet.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.470
How much longer are they 
going to leave us like this?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.580
I want to take a bath and go to bed.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.840
Ema-chan, it's been a while.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.730
I hope you've been doing well, Iroha-san.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.850
Indeed, I have been well.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.510
Thank you for coming.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:11.360
Goodness, Maki-chan, you've grown 
into the elite guard uniform well.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.860
Yukari-sama has summoned you.
 Please come this way.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.990
Where are we?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.690
I think we're in Tokyo.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:21.990
Look at that!

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:23.740
It's so tall!

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.500
So we're on the eastern side of Tokyo?

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.570
Are you both students?

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.110
Just the two of you?

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:00.740
Um... Well...

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.690
Oh, you're here for some kind of concert?

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:09.580
W-We are!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.900
There have been a lot of those lately.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:17.010
We managed somehow.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:23.640
Nice to see you again.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.730
It has been a while, Commander.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:31.150
It's been ages. You truly haven't changed 
a bit in all this time, Yukari-chan.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:35.980
I apologize for the trouble 
my students have caused.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.370
There's no need for any formal apologies.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.480
Do you know where they might be hiding?

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.890
I'm sorry, but I'm not sure.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:45.120
Me, either. My apologies.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.300
Where is my student named Yanase Mai?

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:51.230
Yanase Mai and Iwakura Sanae

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.990
have both been cleared of any 
involvement and released.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:54.630
I see.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.140
Now then, let me ask another question.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:01.470
Heijou Institute president, according to 
your report to the Sword Administration,

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.890
Kogarasumaru was in the care 
of the Heijou Institute,

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.880
but was not currently matched with anyone.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.080
My apologies for the delay 
in reporting to you.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.690
Kogarasumaru chose that girl.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.290
Kogarasumaru?

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:19.900
Etou Kanami is matched with Chidori and 
Juujou Hiyori is matched with Kogarasumaru.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:23.790
Chidori and Kogarasumaru?

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.160
<b>Etou Kanami</b>

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.590
Hello?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.450
<i>Mai-chan?</i>

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.090
Kanami—?!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:38.750
Where are you right now?

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.760
Well, I'm not really sure.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:47.190
I'm sorry for all the problems I've caused. 
I'm totally fine. You don't need to worry.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.120
You can't just tell me that...

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:51.850
<i>This is the Taito disaster 
prevention broadcast...</i>

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.850
I'm sorry, I'm running out of change.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.620
<i>That broadcast...</i>

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:56.880
Um, please take care of my stuff, bye!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.140
Wait!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.950
I'm back!

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.830
I bought us some dinner.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.710
That was my first time 
ever using a coin shower.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.540
I was so nervous wondering if I 
could finish washing myself in time.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:26.090
You have no sense of apprehension, do you?

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:33.980
Well?

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.100
I think I can generate the utsushi.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:40.940
That okatana is even bladed on the backside.

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:44.030
It's an ancient style called a 
double-edged blade.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.200
It also called Kogarasumaru-style.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:51.750
Oh, I see. So that's why you used 
that thrusting technique that time.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.830
That time?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.460
You know, when you were stopped 
by the head of the Origami family?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.630
You were able to see that?

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.860
Yep! Just barely!

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:02.100
I'd never seen a jin'i that fast before!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.470
That technique was really amazing,

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.620
but I really want to see more 
Shintou-style techniques.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.690
You used the shigi no hagaeshi technique 
when you faced that blonde girl, right?

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.310
That would've been dangerous for you, 
had she been able to figure it out.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:15.310
Now then, we will secure
 Juujou Hiyori and Etou Kanami.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:19.060
You both will remain here 
and assist in this matter.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.740
Understood.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.070
Of course.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.820
I wish she would have said they 
wouldn't be rough, though.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.130
Renpu has offered to help, too.

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:37.910
Things will only get more complicated 
once Yukina-chan becomes involved.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:39.080
President!

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:42.210
Yanase-san? What's the matter? 
Shouldn't you be with—

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.090
Well, I have a favor to ask you.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.210
Please allow me to search for Etou-san.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.830
I can't believe they're 
not letting us go home.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:58.600
I heard they called in President Hashima, too.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.930
Mai-chan hasn't come back yet, either.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.610
I wonder what's going to happen to Kanami...

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.780
Lady Mai,

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:09.610
we have managed to pinpoint the location 
from the vocal data you sent us earlier.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:14.770
So it's from Taito Ward and 
Arakawa Ward, understood. Thank you.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.120
Excuse me, please head 
to the designated place.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.430
You're a weird one.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.110
Huh?

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.450
Why won't you ask me anything?

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.150
Like what?

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:48.900
Why I'm after Origami Yukari's life.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:54.910
So the thing you have to finish is 
attacking the head of the Origami family?

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:55.910
Yes.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.660
I see...

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.560
When you're ready to talk 
about it, I'll listen.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.920
We don't have to now.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.820
You really are weird.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.090
Um, excuse me!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.290
Y-Yes?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.070
Do you have two Toji staying here?

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.450
T-Toji-san?

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.280
Kanami-chan?!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.960
They were faster than I thought. How did 
they figure out where we were staying?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.010
Sorry, that's probably my fault.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.870
I called my friend from a payphone yesterday.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:59.920
Well, I figured you'd do something like that.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.020
Sorry...

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.730
<b>Front of Nippori Station</b>

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.730
<b>Non-stop bus</b>

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.730
There's nothing we can do about it.
And I've managed to recover a bit, too.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:05.790
What'll we do?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.390
Let's see...

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.590
We probably won't stand out as much 
in places with lots of people.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:16.400
Just because I said that, doesn't
mean we're here to sightsee!

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:19.660
But you said somewhere with lots 
of people, and this is all I know.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:22.830
There are lots of girls like us and 
girls wearing uniforms around,

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.330
so it'll make it hard to find us, right?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.040
It's Sunday. That's why it's so crowded.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.880
We'll stand out if we 
just keep standing here.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.340
It's more natural for us to at 
least look like we're having fun.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:51.490
Sorry, I'll definitely pay you back sometime.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.360
What's the matter?

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.750
Let's go there.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.950
We need to go over our plans for 
what we're going to do next.

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.370
Oh, okay.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.990
You like mint chocolate chip, Hiyori-chan?

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:12.850
Y-Yes, I do. It is probably the 
most palatable ice cream flavor.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.250
Don't you think it's bitter, though?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.470
It leaves you feeling refreshed, 
kind of like toothpaste.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:17.880
Stupid!

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:18.550
Stupid?!

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.310
That example has already been exhausted

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.760
in the list of pros and cons 
regarding mint chocolate chip.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.640
You may consider it a forbidden phrase.

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:27.590
O-Okay then, sorry.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:38.560
We should look for somewhere to stay.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.210
Kind of like where we stayed yesterday?

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.470
Or somewhere like an internet café.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.040
What's making that noise?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.150
The spectrum meter? An aradama?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.940
There's one close by.

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.350
It's only reacting to one?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.260
Apparently, it hasn't moved yet.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.090
Over there?

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.820
Let's go.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.560
No, let it go.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.180
Now isn't the time to be 
doing something like that.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:09.060
Huh? W-We can't do that!

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:11.700
We have to exterminate it right away, 
or else it will destroy things.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:15.330
The Toji with jurisdiction here are 
probably already apprehending it.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.150
Encountering them would be a pain.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:18.150
But...

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:21.040
They have spectrum finders.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.360
It will not take them long to find it.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:27.620
Besides, even if we could exterminate 
the aradama on our own,

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.190
we cannot collect the noro.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.350
It would just scatter.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.900
That's still better than it causing damage.

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.500
Let's go, Hiyori-chan.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:39.860
If you abandon the aradama now,
 simply because you don't want to get caught,

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.840
it will start to affect you, too!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.180
You—!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.850
Let's go!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.630
<i>Why now?</i>

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:59.820
Excuse me, an aradama has 
been detected nearby.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.910
I'm going to head that way!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:22.010
We are from the Special Religious Military
Unit! Please get away from the aradama!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.600
I'll go, you try to corner it!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.470
Roger that!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.070
Kanami!

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:39.190
Got it!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.610
Hachiman power!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.450
We did it!

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.520
What should we do about collecting the noro?

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.650
Um...

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.540
I will claim it.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.750
Mai-chan!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:00.610
Our pursuer is from Minoseki?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:04.130
Wait, Hiyori-chan!
 Mai-chan is my best friend.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.720
What are you doing here, Mai-chan?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.350
The spectrum finder detected an aradama.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.290
You seem to have already 
exterminated the aradama.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.100
I was able to find you thanks to that.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:17.480
If you're her best friend, then why 
are you pointing your okatana at us?

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.190
I am Kanami-chan's best friend.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:23.360
And because I'm her best friend,
 I'm going to save her!

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:27.040
H-Hang on a second, you two! 
Put away your okatana!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.780
It seems she doesn't intend to.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.650
Mai-chan!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.700
Listen to me, Kanami-chan.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.350
President Hashima promised me 
that if you come back with me,

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:38.460
she'll do everything in her power 
to help lighten your punishment.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:42.270
Kanami, this is your chance. Go back home.

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.470
No way, Hiyori-chan.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.720
But on one condition.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:51.260
Juujou-san, you have to accompany us 
back to the Origami family mansion.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:54.480
Unfortunately, I'm not going to be 
able to cooperate with you on that.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:58.900
You don't have to cooperate.
 I will make you do so by force.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.940
Try it.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.980
For the last year and a half,

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.660
I've always been on the receiving 
end of Kanami-chan's sword.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.740
Juujou-san, your sword is sharp,

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:15.290
but it is far more straightforward 
and easy to avoid than hers.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:19.610
I also noticed yesterday that 
you have no skill with a blade!

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.780
Kanami-chan?

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.310
I'm sorry, Mai-chan.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:28.890
Hiyori-chan and I can't let 
ourselves get caught just yet.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.240
Why?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.270
I saw it!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.750
When she was stopping the blow 
from Hiyori-chan's technique,

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:39.350
she pulled out two okatana 
from an empty space,

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.980
and there was something bad behind her.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.010
Something bad?

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:47.550
So you were able to see it, too?

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:52.910
Only for an instant. I thought 
I was just seeing things.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.120
It was...

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.660
an aradama.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.410
Aradama?!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.540
That can't be...

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.510
She's the head of the Origami family.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.830
She's the legendary hero who 
vanquished the great aradama.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.050
No! That is...

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:12.450
The great aradama in Origami Yukari's form!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:19.840
Then, the Origami family, the Sword
 Administration, and the five schools...

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.810
All of it is being controlled by the aradama.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:28.030
Anyway, I can't leave 
Hiyori-chan alone right now!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:31.040
So please, Mai-chan!

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:37.290
You're... serious about this?

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.380
Okay, then.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:49.370
Mai-chan...

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:55.140
I understand. You're always serious 
about the things you do, Kanami-chan.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.060
You forgot these.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:07.070
They seized the rest of your things 
and I couldn't get them back.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.570
Thanks.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.980
We'll be going, then.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:16.190
Okay. See you later.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.410
Oh, Juujou-san...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.250
Please look after Kanami-chan.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:27.250
I will simply do what I have to do.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:56.290
It's so good, Mai-chan.

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.920
What's this?

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.830
<b>If you have any problems, please call this number</b>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next Episode  Innocent Sword</b>
